Subject: [PATCH] nft_fullcone: own chain subscriptions per network namespace

Base: fullcone-nat-nftables/nft-fullcone
Commit: 07d93b626ce5ea885cd16f9ab07fac3213c355d9
Applied after OpenWrt 010-fix-build-with-kernel-6.12.patch.
Requires the companion NF_CONNTRACK_CHAIN_EVENTS kernel backport.

Use a separate notifier and expression count for every netns. Fail init
and unwind the conntrack reference if subscription fails. Unregister the
exact object and wait for callbacks before pernet/workqueue teardown.
Initialize the workqueue before exposing expressions, with failure unwind.
No changes to parameter parsing, NAT mappings or the netlink ABI.

